 maxillofacial procedures (refer to the CPT &reg; codes as listed in the CPT &reg; /HCPCS Group 7: Paragraph ). The CPT &reg; codes and following diagnoses limit the use of reconstructive surgeries of the head and neck to the repair of injuries due to trauma or ablative surgery. Services billed with a diagnosis code that is not listed under ICD-10-CM Codes that Support Medical Necessity of this article will be denied as not covered. Exceptions will be considered on a case-by-case basis."},"noncovered":{"1":"The following ICD-10-CM codes are non-covered when billed with any CPT &reg; /HCPCS or ICD-10-PCS codes, not just those included in this article."}}}]